<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>AI工具与模型HOT</title><link>https://ai-tool-model-hot.pages.dev/</link><description>每天从 21 个信源（18 个 RSS + 3 个 Hugging Face 组织页）收 AI 模型发布与主流智能体更新，按规则打分精选，只显示标题、一句简介与原文链接，不转载全文。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:10:52 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title>Mellum2.1 Instruct 发布，为编程智能体带来更快响应</title><link>https://blog.jetbrains.com/ai/2026/11/mellum2-1-instruct-is-out-bringing-faster-answers-for-coding-agents</link><description>JetBrains 推出 Mellum2.1 的轻量同门版本，面向子智能体、工具调用循环与对话场景，响应速度更快。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">7dbdf429413629f189eae2b42d601ea3a4884729</guid><source url="https://blog.jetbrains.com/ai/2026/11/mellum2-1-instruct-is-out-bringing-faster-answers-for-coding-agents">JetBrains AI Blog</source></item><item><title>OpenCode v2.4.2</title><link>https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/releases/tag/v2.4.2</link><description>开源 AI 编程智能体 OpenCode 发布 v2.4.2 维护版本，本次未附详细更新说明。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:37:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">0c5213ef953e1b494d249e22f829c22fb597f78e</guid><source url="https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/releases/tag/v2.4.2">OpenCode Releases</source></item><item><title>OpenAI Agents SDK v0.26.0</title><link>https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-python/releases/tag/v0.26.0</link><description>Agents SDK 发布 0.26.0，把 GPT-Live 演示升级到 1.1，并修了外部服务商示例的版本兼容与 Docker 资源限制问题。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 03:22:54 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">0d1de3d8faa044560b468666d65806f6d0906d89</guid><source url="https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-python/releases/tag/v0.26.0">OpenAI Agents SDK Releases</source></item><item><title>用 CUGA 打造印度语语音智能体</title><link>https://huggingface.co/blog/ibm-research/an-indic-voice-agent-with-cuga</link><description>IBM Research 用开源智能体框架 CUGA 做了一个面向印度农民的语音助手：用本地语言口头提问，它检索英文农业手册后用同种语言语音作答，关键在于用多语言嵌入模型解决跨语言检索。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 10:22:09 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">d0a3a7f662b58965bac4af6309f496652b034a9c</guid><source url="https://huggingface.co/blog/ibm-research/an-indic-voice-agent-with-cuga">Hugging Face Blog</source></item><item><title>科学家为 AI 智能体划出界线</title><link>https://huggingface.co/blog/allenai/where-scientists-draw-the-line-on-ai-agents</link><description>科学家们讨论 AI 智能体在科研中可以走多远、哪些红线不能碰，为智能体的自主权划出一条参考边界。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:52:55 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">37b5c9ba932667510c47b67a8eaf7e479db38e02</guid><source url="https://huggingface.co/blog/allenai/where-scientists-draw-the-line-on-ai-agents">Hugging Face Blog</source></item><item><title>围绕人类注意力打造软件工厂</title><link>https://kiro.dev/blog/software-factory-human-attention</link><description>Kiro 团队分享一年实践：让智能体自主跑完从需求发现到上线监控的完整开发流程，并把这套操作手册开源出来，人只在真正需要决策的地方介入。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 20:01:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">a7511ef2aa17d4634e8e6488463693d6f521b4cb</guid><source url="https://kiro.dev/blog/software-factory-human-attention">Kiro Blog</source></item><item><title>Gemini CLI v0.71.1 发布</title><link>https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.71.1</link><description>这是一次补丁版本，将一处修复合入 v0.71.0 发布线，解决该版本的问题。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 03:50:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">56d5c7c32a87562e6a0670aedfac0013cca21586</guid><source url="https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.71.1">Gemini CLI Releases</source></item><item><title>GPT-6 模型展现出内在的蛋白质设计能力</title><link>https://openai.com/index/gpt-6-models-demonstrate-intrinsic-protein-design-capabilities</link><description>GPT-6 仅凭推理与代码就能设计蛋白质结构与序列，实验室测试在五个靶点上都观察到了结合迹象。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 13:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">3c6728c1bfd198791155e7911f8c578086a9a218</guid><source url="https://openai.com/index/gpt-6-models-demonstrate-intrinsic-protein-design-capabilities">OpenAI News</source></item><item><title>Pydantic AI v2.75.0 发布</title><link>https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v2.75.0</link><description>新版收紧了工作区文件的指令权限，RepoContext、Skills 与 Memory 中的内容不再高于 operator 权限，并新增 lowest_authority_under 配置项。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:21:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">13285c6d2bd71e1c132078ffbdb3130712c854ed</guid><source url="https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v2.75.0">Pydantic AI Releases</source></item><item><title>Pydantic AI v2.74.0 发布</title><link>https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v2.74.0</link><description>Pydantic AI 2.74.0 在核心中加入计算机操作工具契约，智能体可以直接调用 ComputerTool 完成电脑操作。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:24:29 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">0f7a3c43cc177f44de084d995ed5d535246a68af</guid><source url="https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v2.74.0">Pydantic AI Releases</source></item><item><title>Qwen Code v1.0.0-preview.2 发布</title><link>https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-preview.2</link><description>Qwen Code 发布 v1.0.0-preview.2：订阅目录新增 Qwen4-Max（百万上下文，支持图片与视频输入），额度用尽时显示重置倒计时，并新增 /upgrade 命令直达订阅页。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 06:37:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">95160328cc4fe2ad2ae00ff0a82416b4fbf35e81</guid><source url="https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-preview.2">Qwen Code Releases</source></item><item><title>在一块 RTX PRO 6000 上爬坡优化 Inkling 2 Mini 推理</title><link>https://huggingface.co/blog/inkling-2-mini-inference-hillclimb</link><description>通过爬坡调优，让 Inkling 2 Mini 在单块 RTX PRO 6000 上的推理跑得更快。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">d8d6777ecf09078330b26ef4bab0c3d0c914ff72</guid><source url="https://huggingface.co/blog/inkling-2-mini-inference-hillclimb">Hugging Face Blog</source></item><item><title>Pydantic AI v1.107.11 发布</title><link>https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v1.107.11</link><description>Pydantic AI 1.x 分支迎来小版本更新，以常规修复为主。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:24:3